<title>JAPAN: Kanagawa Chuo Kotsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kanagawa Chuo Kotsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
